Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Root Topology Projection

Description: Canonical SJS authority for a zero-effect transform that revalidates complete supplied preflight and directory-stability inputs, correlates their root identities and components, and releases one output-only wrapper around a current-M2A-valid RootDirectory form without claiming runtime, physical, inventory, receipt, or admission provenance.

