& [PlanContract] is strict
  + exact profile, nonzero projection identity, nonzero entry-reference identity, and 4096-byte predecode cap
  + serde denies unknown, missing, malformed, and mistyped fields
  + no caller path, mode, ordinal, root identity, length, digest, metadata, or provenance field exists

& [InputContract] requires complete supplied forms
  + public functions accept one WindowsPlatformPreflightRecord and one WindowsSuppliedEntryStabilityInput by value
  + current ValidatePlatformPreflightForm and reconcile_windows_supplied_entry_stability calls are mandatory
  + exact nested PlatformPreflightFormFault and WindowsSuppliedEntryStabilityFault values are preserved
  - never: accept a bare stable pair, root identity, preflight success fragment, seed, or topology observation

& [PreflightContract] is exact
  + current validation precedes variant inspection
  + only CompleteLocal with EligibleLocalNtfs proceeds
  + every other variant or disposition returns preflight_disposition
  + complete preflight record remains unchanged in successful wrapper
  - never: claim valid supplied form proves runtime origin or current physical state

& [EvaluationContract] is ordered
  + validate plan
  + validate complete preflight record
  + require eligible CompleteLocal
  + reconcile complete stability input
  + require exact plan and pair entry-reference equality
  + derive seed and require Directory
  + require exact complete seed identity and preflight root identity equality
  + extract nonempty input-root and volume-GUID-path final components
  + require both components equal stable policy component exactly
  + construct fixed root candidate and invoke current M2A validation
  + release one output-only wrapper
  + first failure returns no partial success

& [IdentityAndComponentContract] is exact supplied correlation
  + StrongFileIdentity comparison includes volume_serial and complete lowercase file_id_hex value through derived Eq
  + input root and volume-GUID path have already passed current preflight syntax validation
  + drive root or any empty final component rejects distinctly
  + extracted components and stable policy component compare by exact String equality
  + no case folding, Unicode normalization, path normalization, filesystem lookup, partial identity, or volume-serial reinterpretation is permitted

& [RootProjectionContract] is fixed
  + relative_path None
  + kind TopologyEntryKind RootDirectory
  + mode_class TopologyModeClass Directory
  + attributes, identity, number_of_links, and streams exact from stable directory seed
  + length None
  + content_sha256 None
  + observation_ordinal 1
  + current ValidateTopologyForm is mandatory and exact fault is nested

& [OutputContract] is non-forgeable
  + WindowsSuppliedRootTopologyProjection has private profile, plan, preflight_record, stable_pair, and topology_observation fields
  + derives Serialize but not Deserialize or Default
  + immutable getters only
  + no public constructor, public field, mutable getter, From, or Into

& [FaultContract] is closed, bounded, and atomic
  + codes are json, profile, projection_identity, entry_reference_identity, preflight, preflight_disposition, stability, entry_reference, kind, identity, input_root_component, final_path_component, component, topology_form, and resource
  + nested preflight, stability, and topology faults appear only under matching codes
  + field and message caps are 64 and 256 Unicode scalars
  + no fault contains success

& [SemanticBoundary] is mandatory
  + supplied, revalidated, derived, correlated, and projected grades remain distinct
  - never: claim runtime origin, physical root identity, path existence or correspondence, handle continuity, actual order, freshness, enumeration, traversal, inventory completeness, Git truth, receipt, admission, mutation safety, or promotion authority

& [ImplementationBoundary] is zero effect
  + one module, one export, module tests, one static test, one evidence test, and governed closure
  + production imports only std formatting, serde, platform forms, stability, and topology forms
  + Cargo, lockfile, unsafe, Windows-call, filesystem, process, environment, clock, random, network, persistence, model, Git, traversal, inventory, receipt, admission, mutation, sealing, cleanup, and promotion deltas are zero

& [RequirementSet] is M2B-SRTPR-001 through M2B-SRTPR-014

& [AcceptanceContract] requires exact source and SJS hashes, direct tests for every gate and mapping, focused and workspace debug and overflow-checked release, format, warnings-denied lint, release build, warnings-denied docs, dependency audit, clone-portable evidence, recursive closure, rollback, and zero physical execution

& [SJSProcessingTrace] is complete
  + source preserved; boundary delineated; fourteen requirements exploded; terms refined; fourteen constraints checked and reapplied; unsafe and redundant surface pruned; downstream growth seeded; data, identity, mapping, cardinality, ownership, faults, and seven folds phase locked; justification, plan, registry, matrix, and slice separately recorded

